SUMMARY:Black Mountain Coffee Crawl 🐊
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nBlack Mountain Coffee Crawl!\nCome explo
 re the charm and whimsy of Black Mountain while checking out the local cof
 fee and shopping.\nPlan is to meet at Recess Coffee around 11:30 am and th
 en walk to Chifferobe\, Black Mountain Variety\, and Sassafras. If time al
 lows\, maybe exploring Laundry Collective\, Nutmeg\, and Dripolator. Feel 
 free to drop in anywhere along the crawl.\nParking can be found on the str
 eet or the off street lot by Recess Coffee\, or the city lot by Mellie Mac
 ’s Garden Shack. Can also park along Cherry St or Main St if preferred.\
 n\n—-Emily will also be at the Black Mountain Tailgate Market at 130 Mon
 treat Rd. The market has Dynamite coffee and Codiewompler Cafe serving unt
 il 12pm. All are welcome to check out the farmers market before the coffee
  crawl officially kicks off ☺️
