SUMMARY:Visit the Folk Art Center
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nCome check out the Folk Art Center\, the
  craft store and exhibition space of the Southern Highland Craft Guild! Th
 e first floor of the center contains the Allanstand Craft Shop\, nationall
 y recognized as the oldest craft shop in America. Upstairs contains multip
 le galleries showcasing traditional and contemporary works by members of t
 he Guild and affiliated organizations. We will be attending during Heritag
 e Weekend\, when several artisans will be on-site demonstrating their craf
 ts. Hope to see you there!
