SUMMARY:Blue Ridge Audubon Swift Viewing 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nBlue Ridge Audubon Swift Night Out\n\nCo
 me watch the flying and roosting habits of local swifts\, hosted by the Bl
 ue Ridge Audubon Society. They meet on the top level of the Civi Center Ga
 rage at 68 Rankin Ave. Parking is available in the garage\, or you can par
 k on the street and use the garage elevator to reach the top floor\nYay bi
 rds!!! 🐦 🐦‍⬛🪹
