SUMMARY:Free Throw & Microwave @ The Orange Peel
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\n**This is a ticketed event. As such ther
 e is a possibility that it may sell out. Please make sure you have purchas
 ed a ticket before rsvping.**\n***You can purchase tickets through the Ora
 nge Peels website: Free Throw & Microwave Tickets | Asheville\, NC | The O
 range Peel [https://share.google/Zqn2LCi8CohF7fv6o](https://share.google/Z
 qn2LCi8CohF7fv6o)***\n\nDo you like 4th wave emo/ we'll call it pop punk?\
 nDo you like going to live shows?\n\nIf so\, Hell yeah!\nI am going to thi
 s anyway and thought it may be a cool way to meet fellow Asheville Introve
 rts members that are into the same music\, or live music in general. I sup
 pose we'll see.\nI plan on going to Easy Tiger to get a couple drinks befo
 re the show. We will meet there around 5:30\, then head over to The Orange
  Peel after the doors open.\nI've seen both bands play live before and thi
 s will be a high-energy environment. I plan on going into any mosh pits th
 at may form. That is all to say that once the music starts\, whomever is t
 here may become scattered. We will regroup between sets and at the end. If
  you're not comfortable with crowds or moshing\, that's totally fine as th
 ere is no expectation that anyone participate.\n\n*Disclaimer: This is a l
 ive music event\, and as such\, neither I nor the Asheville Introverts Mee
 tup group can assume responsibility for your safety. Live music environmen
 ts can involve crowds\, moshing\, and other associated risks. That is not 
 to say that I won't make myself available to help where possible and if ne
 eded. By attending this event\, you acknowledge that you are aware of and 
 accept the associated risks of attending a live performance.*
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/316571343
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260915T200930Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260915T200930Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
