SUMMARY:The Hope of Oz by Montford Players
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nSet a decade after Dorothy’s defeat of
  the Wicked Witch of the West and her subsequent departure\, The Hope of O
 z brings us to a newly invigorated Capital where the Wizard’s power has 
 grown immensely with constant systematic oppression on his denizens and wa
 ging a drug-fueled war with the new cadre of Witches that brings its citiz
 ens to their knees. The story follows Gale\, an investigative “Witch-hun
 ter\,” on the trail of East’s assassination. Trapped in a bar with a s
 ynthetic (known as mimics)\, surrounded by encroaching revolutionaries\, W
 itches\, and the Wizard’s ever watchful eyes\, Gale must survive the nig
 ht if Oz will see its dawn. But in an empire of extremes\, who can survive
 ?\n\nThe show begins at 7:30pm.\nStepped ground seating is free\, remember
  to bring blankets\, pillows\, campchairs\, etc to be more comfortable. If
  you’d like to make an online donation before the show you can do so her
 e: [https://www.montfordparkplayers.org/](https://www.montfordparkplayers.
 org/get-tickets-2/)\n\nThe actors will come around at intermission for cas
 h or venmo donations and they typically have a food and drink vendor of so
 me kind.\n\nAsheville’s Montford Park Players is North Carolina’s long
 est running Shakespeare theatre company dedicated to providing exceptional
  dramatic entertainment for the enrichment\, education\, and enjoyment of 
 their audiences\, free of charge.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314228746
 /
